nts,\n \nstaff,\n \nand\n \nfaculty\n \n●\n \nTeam\n \nplayer,\n \nwith\n \na\n \ndemonstrated\n \nability\n \nto\n \nwork\n \ncollaboratively\n \nand\n \nindependently,\n \nand\n \ndisplay\n \na\n \nhigh\n \ndegree\n \nof\n \ninitiative\n \n●\n \nExcellent\n \nanalytical,\n \nproblem-solving\n \nskills;\n \nability\n \nto\n \nrespond\n \nto\n \na\n \nvariety\n \nof\n \nneeds\n \nof\n \nvarious\n \nstakeholders\n \n●\n \nOutreach,\n \nadvocacy,\n \nand\n \nhealth\n \npromotion\n \nexperience\n \nconsidered\n \nan\n \nasset\n \n●\n \nVulnerable\n \nPolice\n \nSector\n \ncheck\n \nis\n \nrequired.\n \n \n \nSalary\n \nScale:\n \n \n$82,387\n \nto\n \n$102,983\n \nannually\n \n \nTo\n \napply\n \nfor\n \nthis\n \nposition,\n \nplease\n \nsubmit\n \na\n \nresume\n \nand\n \ncover\n \nletter\n \nto\n \ntalent.acquisition@algomau.ca\n \nno\n \nlater\n \nthan\n \n4:00\n \np.m.\n \non\n \nNovember\n \n12,\n \n2026.\n \n \nAlgoma\n \nUniversity\n \nis\n \nstrongly\n \ncommitted\n \nto\n \nfostering\n \ndiversity\n \nand\n \ninclusivity\n \nwithin\n \nour\n \ncommunity\n \nand\n \nis\n \nan\n \nequal-opportunity\n \nemployer.\n \nThe\n \nuniversity\n \ninvites\n \nand\n \nencourages\n \napplications\n \nfrom\n \nall\n \nqualified\n \nindividuals\n \nwho\n \nwould\n \ncontribute\n \nto\n \nthe\n \nfurther\n \ndiversification\n \nof\n \nour\n \nInstitution,\n \nincluding\n \nequity-deserving\n \ngroups\n \nthat\n \nare\n \ntraditionally\n \nunderrepresented\n \nin\n \nemployment\n \n(Indigenous\n \npeoples,\n \nracialized\n \npersons,\n \nwomen,\n \npersons\n \nwith\n \ndisabilities,\n \nand\n \n2SLGBTQQIPA+\n \npersons).\n \n \n \nIn\n \naccordance\n \nwith\n \nthe\n \nAccessibility\n \nfor\n \nOntarians\n \nwith\n \nDisabilities\n \nAct,\n \n2005,\n \nupon\n \nrequest,\n \naccommodation\n \nwill\n \nbe\n \nprovided\n \nby\n \nAlgoma\n \nUniversity\n \nthroughout\n \nthe\n \nrecruitment,\n \nselection,\n \nand/or\n \nassessment\n \nprocess\n \nto\n \napplicants\n \nwith\n \ndisabilities.\n \nAlgoma\n \nUniversity\n \nwelcomes\n \nand\n \nencourages\n \napplications\n \nfrom\n \npeople\n \nwith\n \ndisabilities.\n \nAccommodations\n \nare\n \navailable\n \non\n \nrequest\n \nfor\n \ncandidates\n \ntaking\n \npart\n \nin\n \nall\n \naspects\n \nof\n \nthe\n \nselection\n \nprocess.\n "
